        "description": "# Review code against production\r\n\r\nProofline reviews pull requests against the infrastructure they will deploy into, so you can find evidence-backed deployment risks, inspect the evidence, and see what remains unknown.\r\n\r\n## Evidence behind each finding\r\n\r\nProofline connects your code change to a read-only snapshot of your cloud and checks the constraints between the change and that infrastructure. It then publishes supported findings in GitHub, along with the evidence behind each one.\r\n\r\n## Your infrastructure stays under your control\r\n\r\nInfrastructure integrations are read-only. You choose which repositories to connect and how to address the findings.\r\n\r\n## FREE Code Reviews\r\n\r\nGet one month of [free code review](https://proofline.sh/blog/free-ai-code-review) for private repositories, or free code review for public repositories.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
